[{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>The quadratic equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-4x-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>In each case, without solving the equation find a quadratic equation with integer coefficients with the given roots:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\alpha,2\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-\\alpha,1-\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\alpha+3,2\\beta+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac3\\alpha,\\frac3\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-4x-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=2\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=\\frac12w\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac12w\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3\\left(\\frac12w\\right)^2-4\\left(\\frac12w\\right)-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac34w^2-2w-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3w^2-8w-24=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-4x-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=1-\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=1-w\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-w\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3(1-w)^2-4(1-w)-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3w^2-6w+3-4+4w-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3w^2-2w-7=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-4x-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=2\\alpha+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=\\frac{w-3}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{w-3}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3\\left(\\frac{w-3}2\\right)^2-4\\left(\\frac{w-3}2\\right)-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac34w^2-\\frac92w+\\frac{27}4+6-2w-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac34w^2-\\frac{13}2w+\\frac{27}4=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3w^2-26w+27=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3x^2-4x-6=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> 