/span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3z^3-3z^2+8z+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=2\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=\\frac w2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac w2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3\\left(\\frac w2\\right)^3-3\\left(\\frac w2\\right)^2+8\\left(\\frac w2\\right)+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac38w^3-\\frac34w^2+4w+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3w^3-6w^2+32w+40=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3z^3-3z^2+8z+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=3-\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=3-w\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3-w\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3(3-w)^3-3(3-w)^2+8(3-w)+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-3w^3+27w^2-81w+81-3w^2+18w-27+24-8w+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3w^3-24w^2+71w-83=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3z^3-3z^2+8z+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=2\\alpha-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=\\frac{w+1}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{w+1}2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3\\left(\\frac{w+1}2\\right)^3-3\\left(\\frac{w+1}2\\right)^2+8\\left(\\frac{w+1}2\\right)+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac38(w+1)^3-\\frac34(w+1)^2+4(w+1)+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac38w^3+\\frac98w^2+\\frac98w+\\frac38-\\frac34w^2-\\frac32w-\\frac34+4w+4+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac38w^3+\\frac38w^2+\\frac{29}8w+\\frac{69}8=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3w^3+3w^2+29w+69=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3z^3-3z^2+8z+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\frac\\alpha3+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=3w-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3w-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3(3w-3)^3-3(3w-3)^2+8(3w-3)+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n81w^3-243w^2+243w-81-27w^2+54w-27+24w-24+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n81w^3-270w^2+321w-127=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3z^3-3z^2+8z+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\frac1{2\\alpha}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=\\frac1{2w}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{2w}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3\\left(\\frac1{2w}\\right)^3-3\\left(\\frac1{2w}\\right)^2+8\\left(\\frac1{2w}\\right)+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac3{8w^3}-\\frac3{4w^2}+\\frac4w+5=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac38-\\frac34w+4w^2+5w^3=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"40w^3+32w^2-6w+3=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>The quartic equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2z^4-2z^3+z^2+4z+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\delta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>In each case, without solving the equation, find a quartic equation with integer coefficients with the given roots:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\alpha,2\\beta,2\\gamma,2\\delta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4-\\alpha,4-\\beta,4-\\gamma,4-\\delta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\alpha+3,2\\beta+3,2\\gamma+3,2\\delta+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1\\alpha,\\frac1\\beta,\\frac1\\gamma,\\frac1\\delta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w=2\\alpha\\Rightarrow\\alpha=\\frac w2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2\\left(\\frac w2\\right)^4-2\\left(\\frac w2\\right)^3+\\left(\\frac w2\\right)^2+4\\left(\\frac w2\\right)+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{w^4}8-\\frac{w^3}4+\\frac{w^2}4+2w+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w^4-2w^3+2w^2+16w+56=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w=4-\\alpha\\Rightarrow\\alpha=4-w\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2(4-w)^4-2(4-w)^3+(4-w)^2+4(4-w)+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\begin{aligned}\n2w^4-32w^3+192w^2-512w+512+2w^3-24w^2\\\\{}+96w-128+w^2-8w+16+16-4w+7=0\n\\end{aligned}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2w^4-30w^3+169w^2-428w+423=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w=2\\alpha+3\\Rightarrow\\alpha=\\frac{w-3}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2\\left(\\frac{w-3}2\\right)^4-2\\left(\\frac{w-3}2\\right)^3+\\left(\\frac{w-3}2\\right)^2+4\\left(\\frac{w-3}2\\right)+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac18(w-3)^4-\\frac14(w-3)^3+\\frac14(w-3)^2+2(w-3)+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac18w^4-\\frac32w^3+\\frac{27}4w^2-\\frac{27}2w+\\frac{81}8-\\frac14w^3+\\frac94w^2\\\\{}-\\frac{27}4w+\\frac{27}4+\\frac14w^2-\\frac32w+\\frac94+2w-6+7=0\n\\end{aligned}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac18w^4-\\frac74w^3+\\frac{37}4w^2-\\frac{79}4w+\\frac{161}8=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nw^4-14w^3+74w^2-158w+161=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w=\\frac1\\alpha\\Rightarrow\\alpha=\\frac1w\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2\\left(\\frac1w\\right)^4-2\\left(\\frac1w\\right)^3+\\left(\\frac1w\\right)^2+4\\left(\\frac1w\\right)+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac2{w^4}-\\frac2{w^3}+\\frac1{w^2}+\\frac4w+7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2-2w+w^2+4w+7w^4=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"7w^4+4w^3+w^2-2w+2=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>The quadratic equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2z^2+5z+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find an equation with roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac\\alpha2-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac\\beta2-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=\\frac{41}8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, use your answer to part a) to find the roots of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2z^2+5z+k=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2z^2+5z+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\frac\\alpha2-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=2w+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2w+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2(2w+2)^2+5(2w+2)+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2(4w^2+8w+4)+10w+10+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"8w^2+26w+18+k=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"8w^2+26w+\\frac{185}8=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=-\\frac{13}8\\pm\\frac12i\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\alpha=2\\left(-\\frac{13}8+\\frac12i\\right)+2=-\\frac54+i\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=2\\left(-\\frac{13}8-\\frac12i\\right)+2=-\\frac54-i\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>The curve of</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3+2x^2-10x+k\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The two stationary points of the curve are when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find an expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which is a cubic equation with roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>State the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-coordinates of the stationary points of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3+2x^2-10x+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\alpha-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=w+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(w+2)^3+2(w+2)^2-10(w+2)+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w^3+6w^2+12w+8+2w^2+8w+8-10w-20+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w^3+8w^2+10w-4+k=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Since the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=g(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a translation of the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, the stationary points have translated.</p>","<p>So the stationary points occur when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=a-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=b-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The cubic equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2z^3-z^2+3z+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is an integer has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find an equation with roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac\\alpha2+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac\\beta2+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac\\gamma2+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> it is known that the real solution to the equation you found in part a) is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac34\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Find the real solution to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2z^3-z^2+3z+k=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for the given value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2z^3-z^2+3z+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\frac\\alpha2+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=2w-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2w-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2(2w-2)^3-(2w-2)^2+3(2w-2)+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"16w^3-48w^2+48w-16-4w^2+8w-4+6w-6+k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"16w^3-52w^2+62w-26+k=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\alpha=2\\times\\frac34-2=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>The quadratic equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2+5x-7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>State the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Hence, by making the substitution <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac y{\\alpha\\beta}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> find an equation that has roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha^2\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\\beta^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\alpha\\beta=-7\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\left(\\frac y{\\alpha\\beta}\\right)^2+5\\left(\\frac y{\\alpha\\beta}\\right)-7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\left(\\frac y{-7}\\right)^2+5\\left(\\frac y{-7}\\right)-7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{49}y^2-\\frac57y-7=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y^2-35y-343=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.13-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>The roots of the equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3+kx^2+(2k-5)x+10=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>Find an equation with roots <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3+p(k)x^2+q(k)x+r(k)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3+kx^2+(2k-5)x+10=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\alpha\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a root of the original equation and we want an equation with the root <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w=\\alpha+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then we can rearrange to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha=w-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and sub <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"w-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into the original equation.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(w-3)^3+k(w-3)^2+(2k-5)(w-3)+10=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\begin{aligned}\nw^3-9w^2+27w-27+kw^2-6kw+9k\\\\{}+2kw-5w-6k+15+10=0\n\\end{aligned}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"w^3+(k-9)w^2+(22-4k)w+(3k-2)=0\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]